This file is a subset of ibm_mono, made by "kerneltool vector_fonts" (docs/FONTS.md):
the characters 32 to 126 and the glyph .notdef, each glyph a simple glyph
(3 glyphs made of glyphs were made simple), no hinting instructions, no
OpenType layout tables. The subset carries the name "IBM Mono ASCII".
License of the source: SIL OFL 1.1, Reserved Font Name Plex: renamed.

